  "structs": {
    "Encryption": {
      "index": 0,
      "doc": " Twisted ElGamal encryption with message in the exponent, over Ristretto255.\n\n Uses two generators with unknown discrete log relationship:\n - `g`: the standard Ristretto255 generator\n - `h`: derived via `hash_to_curve(\"fastcrypto-blinding-gen-01\")`, ensuring no one knows `log_g(h)`\n\n Encryption of message `m` with public key `pk = x * g` and randomness `r`:\n   - ciphertext:        `c = r * g + m * h`\n   - decryption handle: `d = r * pk`\n\n Decryption with secret key `x`:\n   - Compute `c - d/x = c - r*g = m * h`\n   - Solve the discrete log `m = log_h(m * h)` via brute force\n\n Homomorphic properties: Encryptions can be added and subtracted component-wise,\n yielding an encryption of the sum or difference of the plaintexts.\n\n Values up to at least ~2^32 can be decrypted.",
      "attributes": [],
      "abilities": [
        "Copy",
        "Drop",
        "Store"
      ],
      "type_parameters": [],
      "fields": {
        "positional_fields": false,
        "fields": {
          "ciphertext": {
            "index": 0,
            "doc": null,
            "type_": {
              "Datatype": {
                "module": {
                  "address": "myso",
                  "name": "group_ops"
                },
                "name": "Element",
                "type_arguments": [
                  {
